      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I much rather learn a person's preferences by getting to know them than having this stuff put in front of my face like some kind of advertisement taking up screen and mental space.\n\nOr going to read their bio is good enough for me because then I'm actively wanting to find the information. In fact, leaving it at that will give people less reason to put nonsense text there as they are already doing because they're using it as another \"custom status\".",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
