      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This, I have already seen a few people abusing the system with slurs, memes, and long text; I don't wanna see all that. In addition, the UI is already cluttered as it is for someone who is sight impaired. The pronouns being shown at the top of people's profiles is sufficient enough IMHO.\n\nEdit: Added some examples of some \"pronouns\" that i saw just last night that I wish i could hide.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
