      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's a very good idea. The pronouns is always displayed on the screen, and does not have a separate disable function.\n\nYou can customize the display of any, even the smallest and most insignificant elements, but you cannot disable the entire text field of, in some cases, useless info.\n\nA good compromise would be to display the pronouns when opening the menu, as it currently works with the status.",
